        "original_id": "8e477927-c632-57a0-937f-70c516ac8510",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roy Lassiter, Ariel Lassiter, David Beckham, David Ginola, Raúl, Paolo Maldini, Andreas Möller\n- Organizations: LA Galaxy, Major League Soccer, Western Conference\n- Products: FIFA: Road to World Cup 98\n- Places: Carson, California, Los Angeles\n\nFacts:\n- FIFA: Road to World Cup 98 featured different cover athletes by market, including Roy Lassiter in the USA, Mexico, and Brazil; David Beckham in the UK; David Ginola in France; Raúl in Spain; Paolo Maldini in Italy; and Andreas Möller in Germany.\n- LA Galaxy is an American professional soccer franchise based in Carson, California, a suburb of Los Angeles.\n- LA Galaxy competes in Major League Soccer as a member of the league's Western Conference.\n- Roy Lassiter is the father of LA Galaxy player Ariel Lassiter.",
